	)
	(text "GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.13 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "52c78538-6bc9-4548-a258-9c6331cd8197")
	)
	(text "Analog mics on right and left sides"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.97 105.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5e03ab16-1a21-4145-941a-d801ada33ccb")
	)
	(text "POWER\nBattery 21700 (3.7V) for maximum power density.\nThegulator to provide 5V with cutoff on low voltage to \nprotect the battery. The resistors to EN are computed \nso that to cutoff at 3.0V (when EN = 1V), and low enough \nso that the EN current is negligeable. The tolerance for \nthese resistors should be at most 0.1% for precise \ncutoff at 3V.  The max load at 3.7V input is ~2.5 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "60836d30-130f-4900-866e-0bc88e55a57e")
	)
	(text "Level shifting from 3.3V to 5V, from ESP32 S3 CAM A only for the leds, and I2C signals"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.09 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "6c4c3cc8-cc8d-4bbf-9f47-b277109f90b0")
	)
	(text "I2S Class D Amplifier"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 207.01 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "71676a34-db23-45ae-b83d-b2bb75bf4014")
	)
	(text "Microcroconllers - 2 x ESP32 S3 CAM boards\n\nThe controller boards are fixated onto backboards which then connect vertically \nto this main board on Connectors Pin Socket 2x7 and 2x8. There are 11 GPIO drawn\nout to each of the connectors, and with 3.3V, GND and 5v, the total is 14. However,\nthe ESP32-S3 CAM A connects to a 2x8 connector in the sole purpose of prevent\nmistaken connections.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7fe958aa-f4d6-49f3-a88c-a1a1e497225e")
	)
	(text "Motor drivers\n\nPin A0, A1 states are chosen so that the left motor is addresable on I2C\nat the address 0x63 and right motore at 0x64.\nThe Isense pin regulate the current load, limiting the current to a maximum driven by\nthe resistor value connected to GND. The value is 0.22 ohms, Ilimit = 200mV/R = 1A. \nThese are 2 resistors of 0.44 Ohm in parallel to increase power while reducing cost.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85.09 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b006304f-f557-4e4d-a0a4-67c9bc5a4444")
	)
	(text "Mini OLED Display"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cd7f707e-fee2-4472-a678-7a78502ff869")
	)
